# Local development only: copy to .dev.vars, then set your own random value (32+ characters).
# Cloudflare Git import does NOT automatically turn this file into runtime secrets.
# After deploying: Worker > Settings > Variables and Secrets > Add > Secret > SETUP_TOKEN.
# Save and Deploy, then refresh the website to initialize your account.
# Never commit .dev.vars or a real token.
SETUP_TOKEN=
